---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="footer-cta">
    <div class="container footer-cta__inner">
      <p class="eyebrow">Schreiben Sie uns</p>
      <h2>Schreiben Sie uns eine Email oder rufen Sie an!</h2>
      <a href="/kontakt/" class="button button--accent">Email / Telefon</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="container footer-main">
    <div class="footer-col footer-col--brand">
      <a href="/" class="brand">
        <img src="/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/logo.svg" alt="icanspeak.it" width="36" height="36" />
        <span>icanspeak.it</span>
      </a>
      <p class="text-muted">
        Der Schutz Ihrer personenbezogenen Daten ist uns wichtig. Wir behandeln sie vertraulich, entsprechend
        der gesetzlichen Datenschutzvorschriften und gemäß der DSGVO.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-col">
      <h4>Angebot</h4>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="/angebot/#Berufssprache">Berufssprache</a></li>
        <li><a href="/angebot/#Lernplattformen">Lernplattformen</a></li>
        <li><a href="/angebot/#Pipeline">Pipeline A1/B2</a></li>
        <li><a href="/angebot/#TeacherTraining">TeacherTraining</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-col">
      <h4>Weiteres</h4>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="/impressum/">Impressum / Datenschutz</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-col">
      <h4>Kontakt</h4>
      <address>
        Ansbacher Str. 48<br />
        10777 Berlin<br />
        <a href="tel:+4917669299755">+49 176 692 997 55</a><br />
        <a href="mailto:info@icanspeak.it">info@icanspeak.it</a>
      </address>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="footer-bottom">
    <div class="container footer-bottom__inner">
      <p>Copyright &copy; {year} icanspeak.it</p>
      <p>Powered by icanspeak.it</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .site-footer {
    background: var(--color-ink);
    color: #cbd2dd;
  }

  .footer-cta {
    background: var(--color-primary-dark);
    color: #fff;
  }

  .footer-cta__inner {
    padding-block: clamp(2.5rem, 4vw, 4rem);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .footer-cta .eyebrow {
    color: #a9d9d9;
  }

  .footer-cta h2 {
    color: #fff;
    max-width: 34rem;
    margin-inline: auto;
    margin-block-end: 1.75rem;
  }

  .footer-main {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.4fr repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 2.5rem;
    padding-block: clamp(2.5rem, 4vw, 4rem);
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .footer-main {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .footer-main {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }
  }

  .footer-col h4 {
    color: #fff;
    margin-block-end: 1rem;
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  .footer-col ul {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.65rem;
  }

  .footer-col a {
    color: #cbd2dd;
  }

  .footer-col a:hover {
    color: #fff;
  }

  .footer-col--brand .brand {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #fff;
    margin-block-end: 1rem;
  }

  .footer-col--brand p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    max-width: 32ch;
  }

  address {
    font-style: normal;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .footer-bottom {
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
  }

  .footer-bottom__inner {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem 1.5rem;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding-block: 1.25rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: #8b94a3;
  }
</style>
